  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Innovation Hubs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this initiative is to create regional Innovation Hubs in the Feed the Future target and resilience focus countries that will foster private sector innovation, agricultural research, education, extension and training, and public-sector capacity building through improved collaboration, communication and knowledge sharing on aspects related to climate smart agriculture (CSA) and food and nutritional security in the various regions.</narrative>
  </description>
